Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
2026-10-04 the desk had <ProblemCount ticket={4471} /> unique reports.

**Merged as one issue, then split by cause.** Matching subjects hid parser and booking-form
hint reports. The five one-day observations remain included in parser, not a third verified cause.
See [the split and observations](/kb/incidents/4471-split).

